#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:137
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_GymGuideAdvice"
msgid ""
"Yo, how's it going, CHAMPION-\n"
"bound {PLAYER}?\p"
"FORTREE GYM LEADER WINONA is\n"
"a master of FLYING-type POKéMON.\p"
"She's waiting at the back of this GYM,\n"
"behind the rotating doors.\p"
"She's waiting for new challengers\n"
"who are trying to take wing!\p"
"Okay, go for it!$"
msgstr ""
"哟，最近怎么样？\n"
"以冠军为目标的{PLAYER}！\p"
"茵郁市道馆馆主娜琪是\n"
"飞行属性宝可梦的高手。\p"
"她就在这座道馆的最里面，\n"
"旋转门的后面等着你。\p"
"她正在等待想要展翅高飞的新挑战者！\p"
"好了，加油吧！$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:148
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_GymGuidePostVictory"
msgid ""
"You did it!\n"
"You've achieved liftoff!$"
msgstr "你做到了！你成功起飞了！$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:152
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_JaredIntro"
msgid ""
"Behold the elegant battle style of\n"
"BIRD POKéMON!$"
msgstr "见识一下鸟宝可梦优雅的战斗风格吧！$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:156
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_JaredDefeat"
msgid ""
"You…\n"
"You're strong…$"
msgstr "你……你好强……$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:160
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_JaredPostBattle"
msgid ""
"A TRAINER has to be smart to keep\n"
"up with unexpected turns of events.\p"
"Do you have the smarts to get to\n"
"our LEADER?$"
msgstr ""
"训练家必须足够聪明，\n"
"才能应对意料之外的变化。\p"
"你有足够的智慧走到我们馆主面前吗？$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:166
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_EdwardoIntro"
msgid ""
"The lovers of BIRD POKéMON aspire\n"
"to join this GYM.\p"
"As a member of the FORTREE GYM,\n"
"I'm not allowed to lose!$"
msgstr ""
"喜爱鸟宝可梦的人都向往加入这座道馆。\p"
"身为茵郁道馆的一员，我是不能输的！$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:172
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_EdwardoDefeat"
msgid ""
"It was too much of a load for me\n"
"to bear…$"
msgstr "这担子对我来说太重了……$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:176
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_EdwardoPostBattle"
msgid ""
"The world is huge, and there are\n"
"countless tough TRAINERS.\p"
"I'm going to keep training and make\n"
"myself even stronger.$"
msgstr ""
"世界那么大，厉害的训练家数也数不清。\p"
"我要继续修行，让自己变得更强。$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:182
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_FlintIntro"
msgid ""
"There's no need for WINONA, our GYM\n"
"LEADER, to deal with you!\p"
"I'm plenty good enough for you!$"
msgstr ""
"根本用不着我们的道馆馆主娜琪出马！\p"
"对付你，我一个人就绰绰有余了！$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:187
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_FlintDefeat"
msgid ""
"WINONA, I…\n"
"I lost!$"
msgstr "娜琪，我……我输了！$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:191
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_FlintPostBattle"
msgid ""
"WINONA is cute and she's strong.\n"
"She's the ultimate LEADER!\p"
"Blush…$"
msgstr ""
"娜琪又可爱又强大，是最棒的馆主！\p"
"（脸红）……$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:196
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_AshleyIntro"
msgid ""
"WINONA taught me personally!\n"
"You can't beat me easily!$"
msgstr ""
"我可是娜琪亲自指导过的！\n"
"你没那么容易打败我！$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:200
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_AshleyDefeat"
msgid "I was beaten…$"
msgstr "我被打败了……$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:203
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_AshleyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Thanks to WINONA, the people of\n"
"FORTREE can live without fear.$"
msgstr ""
"多亏了娜琪，\n"
"茵郁市的人们才能安心地生活。$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:207
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_HumbertoIntro"
msgid ""
"When WINONA takes to battle, her face\n"
"shines with beautiful determination…\p"
"I'm not letting you witness that\n"
"lovely sight!$"
msgstr ""
"娜琪投入战斗的时候，\n"
"脸上会闪耀着美丽而坚定的光芒……\p"
"我才不会让你看到那么美的景象！$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:213
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_HumbertoDefeat"
msgid ""
"Urk!\n"
"I couldn't stop you.$"
msgstr "呜！我没能拦住你。$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:217
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_HumbertoPostBattle"
msgid ""
"You'd better watch it!\n"
"Don't get distracted staring at WINONA\l"
"or you'll go crashing down in a heap!$"
msgstr ""
"你可要小心！要是光顾着盯着\n"
"娜琪看而分了心，你会一头栽下去的！$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:222
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_DariusIntro"
msgid ""
"You'd better know that there are all\n"
"sorts of FLYING-type POKéMON.\p"
"You do know that, right?$"
msgstr ""
"你要知道，\n"
"飞行属性宝可梦有各种各样的种类。\p"
"你应该知道吧？$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:227
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_DariusDefeat"
msgid "You seem to know your stuff!$"
msgstr "看来你很懂行嘛！$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:230
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_DariusPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Sure, you beat me all right.\n"
"But you'd better watch it! Our LEADER\l"
"WINONA's POKéMON are all business.$"
msgstr ""
"没错，你是打败了我。但你可要当心！我\n"
"们馆主娜琪的宝可梦可都是动真格的。$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:235
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_WinonaIntro"
msgid ""
"I am WINONA. I am the LEADER of\n"
"the FORTREE POKéMON GYM.\p"
"I have become one with BIRD POKéMON\n"
"and have soared the skies…\p"
"However grueling the battle, we have\n"
"triumphed with grace…\p"
"Witness the elegant choreography\n"
"of BIRD POKéMON and I!$"
msgstr ""
"我是娜琪，茵郁市宝可梦道馆的馆主。\p"
"我与鸟宝可梦融为一体，翱翔于天际……\p"
"无论战斗多么艰苦，\n"
"我们都优雅地取得了胜利……\p"
"见识一下我和鸟宝可梦优雅的共舞吧！$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:245
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_WinonaDefeat"
msgid ""
"Never before have I seen a TRAINER\n"
"command POKéMON with more grace\l"
"than I…\p"
"In recognition of your prowess,\n"
"I present to you this GYM BADGE.$"
msgstr ""
"我从未见过指挥宝可梦比我还\n"
"要优雅的训练家……\p"
"为了表彰你的实力，\n"
"我把这枚道馆徽章送给你。$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:252
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedFeatherBadge"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} received the FEATHER BADGE\n"
"from WINONA.$"
msgstr "{PLAYER}从娜琪那里得到了羽毛徽章。$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:256
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_ExplainFeatherBadgeTakeThis"
msgid ""
"With the FEATHER BADGE, all POKéMON up\n"
"to LV 70, even those received through\l"
"trades, will obey your every command.\p"
"You will also be able to use\n"
"the HM move FLY outside of battle.\p"
"And this…\n"
"This is a gift from me.$"
msgstr ""
"有了羽毛徽章，等级70以下的宝可梦，\n"
"就算是通过交换得到的，\l"
"也会听从你的一切指令。\p"
"而且你还能在\n"
"战斗以外使用秘传招式飞翔。\p"
"还有这个……这是我送给你的礼物。$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:265
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_ExplainAerialAce"
msgid ""
"TM40 contains AERIAL ACE.\p"
"Its speed…\n"
"No POKéMON should be able to avoid it.\p"
"… … … … … …$"
msgstr ""
"招式学习器40里面是燕返。\p"
"它的速度……没有宝可梦能躲得开。\p"
"…… …… …… …… …… ……$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:271
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_RegisteredWinona"
msgid ""
"Registered GYM LEADER WINONA\n"
"in the POKéNAV.$"
msgstr "在宝可导航里登记了道馆馆主娜琪。$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:275
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_WinonaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Though I fell to you, I will remain\n"
"devoted to BIRD POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"虽然输给了你，\n"
"但我依然会全心投入在鸟宝可梦身上。$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:279
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue"
msgid "FORTREE CITY POKéMON GYM$"
msgstr "茵郁市宝可梦道馆$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:282
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_GymStatueCertified"
msgid ""
"FORTREE CITY POKéMON GYM\p"
"WINONA'S CERTIFIED TRAINERS:\n"
"{PLAYER}$"
msgstr ""
"茵郁市宝可梦道馆\n"
"娜琪认可的训练家：\l"
"{PLAYER}$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:287
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_WinonaPreRematch"
msgid ""
"WINONA: We humans can never escape\n"
"gravity's pull on the ground.\p"
"But by striving for excellence,\n"
"we have the power to soar!\p"
"You have scaled the pinnacle as\n"
"the reigning CHAMPION.\p"
"Please, allow me to see your power\n"
"at full flight!$"
msgstr ""
"娜琪：\n"
"我们人类永远无法摆脱地面的重力。\p"
"但只要追求卓越，\n"
"我们就拥有翱翔的力量！\p"
"你已经作为现任冠军登上了顶峰。\p"
"请让我见识一下你全力飞翔的力量吧！$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:297
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_WinonaRematchDefeat"
msgid "I failed to reach your height again…$"
msgstr "我又没能飞到你的高度……$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:300
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_WinonaPostRematch"
msgid ""
"WINONA: Even though I have lost,\n"
"the wings of my heart remain unbroken.\p"
"I can rise and soar again and\n"
"yet again.\p"
"I am convinced of it!$"
msgstr ""
"娜琪：虽然我输了，\n"
"但我心中的翅膀并没有折断。\p"
"我能一次又一次地重新飞起来。\p"
"我对此深信不疑！$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc:307
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Gym_Text_WinonaRematchNeedTwoMons"
msgid ""
"WINONA: We humans can never escape\n"
"gravity's pull on the ground.\p"
"But by striving for excellence,\n"
"we have the power to soar!\p"
"You have scaled the pinnacle as\n"
"the reigning CHAMPION.\p"
"Please, allow me to see your power\n"
"at full flight!\p"
"Oh, no… Do you have but one\n"
"POKéMON with you?\p"
"Please return with two POKéMON\n"
"at the very least.$"
msgstr ""
"娜琪：\n"
"我们人类永远无法摆脱地面的重力。\p"
"但只要追求卓越，\n"
"我们就拥有翱翔的力量！\p"
"你已经作为现任冠军登上了顶峰。\p"
"请让我见识一下你全力飞翔的力量吧！\p"
"哎呀……你只带了一只宝可梦吗？\p"
"请至少带上两只宝可梦再来吧。$"
